        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Hetfield\n- Organizations: Metallica\n- Products: \"Enter Sandman\", Metallica (album), \"The Unforgiven\", \"Nothing Else Matters\", \"Wherever I May Roam\", \"Sad but True\"\n- Concepts: child's nightmares\n\nFacts:\n- Metallica is an American heavy metal band.\n- \"Enter Sandman\" is a song by Metallica.\n- James Hetfield, Metallica's vocalist and rhythm guitarist, wrote the lyrics for \"Enter Sandman\".\n- The lyrics of \"Enter Sandman\" deal with the concept of a child's nightmares.\n- Metallica (album) produced five singles that are considered among Metallica's best-known songs.\n- The five singles from Metallica (album) are \"Enter Sandman\", \"The Unforgiven\", \"Nothing Else Matters\", \"Wherever I May Roam\", and \"Sad but True\".",
